    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "A bird calls once; the hill sends the sound back.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "We answer with a letter and the bird name on its track.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Albatross appears—A found it. Albatross in sight | feathers, beak, and feet give clues just right",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B ... Budgie; Budgie is a feathered bird; beak and feet hint at how it lives.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A tiny pause for C, then Crane! It is a feathered bird; beak and feet hint at how it lives.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "across the open sky, Duck belongs with D. Duck is a water-side bird; beak, legs, and feet fit its watery habitat.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
